          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "நச்சரி (naccari) is native Tamil, usually traced to நச்சு naccu, \"to tease, to vex\" (DEDR 3577), which does not list this form itself."
