              "text": "குறுகுறு — kuṟukuṟu — \"to tickle; to prick\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "பொய் சொன்னதால் என் மனம் குறுகுறுத்தது. poy coṉṉatāl eṉ maṉam kuṟukuṟuttatu. Because I had told a lie, my conscience pricked me."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (it …): குறுகுறுத்தது, kuṟukuṟuttatu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A doubled sound word; the subject is the mind or a part of the body, so the past is குறுகுறுத்தது."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "குறுகுறு (kuṟukuṟu) is a doubled native word whose origin is not settled; DEDR has no entry for this sense."
            }
          ]
        },
